    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205322
    m_Localized: Choose a trophy to take with Rin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205323
    m_Localized: Wear it on the map. No puzzle advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205324
    m_Localized: One safe move. Normal wood cost. Once per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205325
    m_Localized: Preview row after descent. No pieces move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205326
    m_Localized: One safe move. Normal wood cost. Once per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205327
    m_Localized: Preview the next landing. Pieces stay put until Descend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205328
    m_Localized: Next landing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205329
    m_Localized: This is the last board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205330
    m_Localized: This landing would lose the row. Try another move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205331
    m_Localized: The row is ready. You can bring it home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205332
    m_Localized: This is where the pieces will land. Keep arranging below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 555995448205333
    m_Localized: Keep playing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 557615414239232
