    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 561463105150976
    m_Localized: Up to 2 stars. No record.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 561463105150977
    m_Localized: The row would arrive home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 561463105150978
    m_Localized: The row will match the target on the next board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 564361234997248
    m_Localized: 'World complete: {0}/{0} levels'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 564361239191552
    m_Localized: Next world in {0} level, {1}/{2}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 564361239191553
    m_Localized: Next world in {0} levels, {1}/{2}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 566306465112064
    m_Localized: 'You are here: {0}/{1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283319615488
    m_Localized: Brilliant!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809792
    m_Localized: Beautifully done!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809793
    m_Localized: Delivered!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809794
    m_Localized: Made it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809795
    m_Localized: A perfect, swift route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809796
    m_Localized: Aim for fewer moves and undos.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809797
    m_Localized: Moves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809798
    m_Localized: Undos
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 570283323809799
    m_Localized: Time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 584621170352128
    m_Localized: Your stars and score are saved for this mode.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057918808064
    m_Localized: Walter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196672
    m_Localized: Nora
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196673
    m_Localized: Clara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196674
    m_Localized: Oscar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196675
    m_Localized: Lumi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196676
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196677
    m_Localized: Not now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196678
    m_Localized: Next line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196679
    m_Localized: Back to the map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196680
    m_Localized: Walter here. The storm broke our bridges. I can mend the wood if
      you bring back the lights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196681
    m_Localized: I am Ben. Our mill has stopped. Without it, the village has no water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196682
    m_Localized: I am Rose. My lantern trees went dark. Even the birds cannot find
      their nests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196683
    m_Localized: Nora, sky post! Well... ground post today. The wind scattered all
      our letters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196684
    m_Localized: I am Clara. The pond lamps went out. My little boats cannot find
      the shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196685
    m_Localized: Oscar. I keep the maps. The storm hid the road to the beacon between
      these shelves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196686
    m_Localized: I am Alice. I know the snow road. We will follow the warm lights
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196687
    m_Localized: Rin! There you are. The beacon is dark, but I kept a little light
      for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196688
    m_Localized: I am Rin. I am taking a light to Grandma Ada at the beacon. Let
      us start here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196689
    m_Localized: We will get it turning. I would like to hear the water again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196690
    m_Localized: Let us light one tree first. Then the birds can show us the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196691
    m_Localized: One of those letters is for Grandma Ada. Let us find it together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196692
    m_Localized: I can help with the lamps. I will stay close to the shore!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196693
    m_Localized: We have come so far. Let us find the last part of the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196694
    m_Localized: My paws are cold, but my lantern is still warm. Lead the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196695
    m_Localized: I kept mine too, Grandma Ada. Let us bring them home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196696
    m_Localized: Light the market landings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196697
    m_Localized: Open the lit route to Ben
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196698
    m_Localized: Restore the mill's lower lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196699
    m_Localized: Light the wells; record the time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196700
    m_Localized: Take the crate evidence to Rose
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196701
    m_Localized: Light the lamp by the old tree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196702
    m_Localized: Light and check the orchard bridge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196703
    m_Localized: Open the harvest-cart path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196704
    m_Localized: Warm the seed house; copy the loan
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196705
    m_Localized: Open the route to Nora
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196706
    m_Localized: Recover the mail at a lit landing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196707
    m_Localized: Make the mail-cart route safe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196708
    m_Localized: Take the receipt to the lagoon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196709
    m_Localized: Light the lagoon; check the log
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196710
    m_Localized: Light the landing and clear the low beam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196711
    m_Localized: Take the tide record to Oscar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196712
    m_Localized: First lamp lit. I'll sign the anchor. I've checked it often enough
      to know it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196713
    m_Localized: And I can see the next step. That feels less scary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196714
    m_Localized: The gate holds against the wind. You checked the far latch before
      I asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196715
    m_Localized: I'm still scared. But now I know what to look at.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057927196716
    m_Localized: The lift works. Ben's wheel stopped at the same time as this relay.
      He may have seen more than I did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390976
    m_Localized: We'll ask him when we get the market route open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390977
    m_Localized: The market lamp is steady. The baker sent bread. He says I'm to
      eat it warm, without measuring it first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390978
    m_Localized: Save Ben a piece. You eat yours now. I'll hold the rope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390979
    m_Localized: The road to the mill is safe. I will keep these bridges lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390980
    m_Localized: That clears your chisel. Ben heard the crate at the mill; let's
      ask him about that night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390981
    m_Localized: The wheel turns without a knock. My brother asked who broke the
      pipe. I told him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390982
    m_Localized: It sounds like the village waking up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390983
    m_Localized: His tap runs. He made me wait there while he filled the bucket himself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390984
    m_Localized: Now nobody has to carry it all that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390985
    m_Localized: The wells are lit. This slip fell off the crate. Its time matches
      the clock; my brother saw it before the rain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390986
    m_Localized: Then your little brother can help too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390987
    m_Localized: The post boat floats again. There is a letter for your gran aboard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390988
    m_Localized: I will make sure it gets there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390989
    m_Localized: The orchard gate is open. Here are the dust and Rose's seal, wrapped
      as you asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390990
    m_Localized: Thanks. I'll take the loading slip too. Nora can check it against
      her flight book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390991
    m_Localized: The old tree has light. We missed the roots. Tomorrow I'll check
      the soil beside the rope hasn't slipped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390992
    m_Localized: They are singing louder than my lantern can shine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390993
    m_Localized: The bridge is lit. I'll return Walter's chisel myself; he shouldn't
      have to come looking for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390994
    m_Localized: Ask him to check the bridge while he's here. He knows which joint
      the storm damaged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390995
    m_Localized: Walter checked the track. Ben sent his cart for the jars, with water
      for the seedlings on the return trip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390996
    m_Localized: Then leave room for the water cans. I'll help load the jars before
      we go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390997
    m_Localized: 'Here: felt for Felix''s new lens. Nora took the empty crate to
      Ada first, then collected a sealed load there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390998
    m_Localized: Little lights for the next travellers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931390999
    m_Localized: The post gate is open. Three seeds for Ada, and a signed copy of
      the crate loan for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391000
    m_Localized: Another friend on the road. I like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391001
    m_Localized: Every letter recovered. One had no address; its owner came to ask
      before we could guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391002
    m_Localized: That small one is Grandma Ada's. Please keep it dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391003
    m_Localized: Your letter is on its way. I put it in my safest bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391004
    m_Localized: Keep your copy. I'll take a tracing to Ada; she can tell us what
      she approved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391005
    m_Localized: The cart crossed. I walked beside it. It's a much longer bridge
      when you can't flap over the gap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391006
    m_Localized: Will you try it once more with the mail aboard? I'll watch the far
      wheel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391007
    m_Localized: The basket is up! I should write a letter too. I just never know
      how to start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391008
    m_Localized: 'Try: I missed you. That is a good start.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391009
    m_Localized: Clara is waiting by the lagoon. She makes boats out of leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391010
    m_Localized: I hope mine will have a very small sail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057931391011
    m_Localized: The pier is whole again. You can come closer, Rin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057943973888
    m_Localized: Only a little. Deep water still makes my paws shake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057943973889
    m_Localized: The channel lamps are steady. I've copied the sighting for Ada;
      the original stays in my log.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057943973890
    m_Localized: Two lights from one. Grandma Ada would love this place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168192
    m_Localized: The water gate is open. The little boats can go home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168193
    m_Localized: The beacon is still dark. I hope Grandma Ada can see my letter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168194
    m_Localized: Full tank, clean lens. And take these surveys for Ada. Felix measured
      the north channel from my boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168195
    m_Localized: They look like tiny stars swimming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168196
    m_Localized: The archive path is lit. Tell Oscar to look under the north petitions.
      He'll know the shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168197
    m_Localized: Thank you, Clara. I will come back when the lamps are all lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168198
    m_Localized: The page is safe. Felix signed for the key before the storm. There's
      no return entry yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168199
    m_Localized: Thank you. The original can stay here. I'll take the copy and Nora's
      order to Ada.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168200
    m_Localized: The shelves move again. Spare key tied to the register. No exceptionally
      safe hiding places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168201
    m_Localized: What is it about? I would like to read it with Grandma Ada.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168202
    m_Localized: Here is the storm map. The snow road leads straight to the beacon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168203
    m_Localized: It looks far on paper. We will take it one step at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168204
    m_Localized: The petitions are dry. Clara asked first. Felix drew the route.
      Both replies say Deferred.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168205
    m_Localized: Ada needs to read these again. Clara's boats are still taking that
      route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168206
    m_Localized: 'This note is from Grandma Ada: I am waiting. There is soup on the
      stove.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168207
    m_Localized: Then we had better not let it get cold. Where is Alice?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057948168208
    m_Localized: The new path is lit. I've crossed the old one out and marked the
      way round for Oscar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362496
    m_Localized: Sign the correction. I'll bring it back to Oscar with the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362497
    m_Localized: The shelter is warm again. We can rest our paws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362498
    m_Localized: Just a moment. I want to tell Grandma Ada about everyone we met.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362499
    m_Localized: The arch holds. You planned the turned landing without asking me
      to name the order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362500
    m_Localized: I still need you on that far anchor. Ready for the next one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362501
    m_Localized: The spare blanket is dry in the shelter. Its lamp can be seen from
      the lower path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362502
    m_Localized: I'll write Ben where it is. And that we're using his first blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362503
    m_Localized: There is the beacon road. You can see Grandma Ada's window from
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362504
    m_Localized: A light in her window! She really is waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362505
    m_Localized: The bridge is safe. Come here. You waited for both anchors, just
      as I taught you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362506
    m_Localized: Your hands are still on the rail. Good. Now I can come and put this
      bag down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362507
    m_Localized: Yes. Felix collected both; he signed here. He should still have
      them at the observatory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362508
    m_Localized: Then we'll compare his copy with Nora's delivery order. Someone
      changed the instructions between them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362509
    m_Localized: Yes, a lens sleeve could leave that mark. It tells us where the
      load passed, not who wrote the order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362510
    m_Localized: They still do. But now I know how to keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362511
    m_Localized: The sky lantern is up. Your little light made it all the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057952362512
    m_Localized: I was scared sometimes. The others stayed with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556800
    m_Localized: The beacon receivers are ready. Take my keeper's cord, Rin. I will
      keep watch here, not climb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556801
    m_Localized: Then let us wave to everyone. We made it home together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556802
    m_Localized: Your paws are shaking. We can take a breath before the next board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556803
    m_Localized: A breath, then a step. I can do that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556804
    m_Localized: That board held. My hammer and your patience make a good team.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556805
    m_Localized: Your hammer is much louder than my patience.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556806
    m_Localized: I'm reaching for the fast lever again. Red thread. Right. Hands
      off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057956556807
    m_Localized: Keep one paw on the brake. We can afford another minute; not another
      broken pipe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751104
    m_Localized: Can you hear the mill from here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751105
    m_Localized: Yes. I like knowing it is still working.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751106
    m_Localized: One branch at a time. That is how a tree grows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751107
    m_Localized: And one board at a time for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751108
    m_Localized: I think a bird is following your lantern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751109
    m_Localized: It can come. There is room for one more friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751110
    m_Localized: I could fly to the next desk and be back before this basket lands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751111
    m_Localized: I can't see your signal from there. Stay until the basket lands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751112
    m_Localized: 'This letter only says: Come for tea.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751113
    m_Localized: That is plenty. I would go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751114
    m_Localized: The pond is quiet today. We can hear ourselves think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057960751115
    m_Localized: I am thinking about that next board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945408
    m_Localized: That little boat takes the long channel. The short one is too shallow
      for her keel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945409
    m_Localized: I'll mark that on my copy. I'd have chosen the short way from the
      shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945410
    m_Localized: We need the right order, just like books on a shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945411
    m_Localized: Then I will leave the silly book next to the scary one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945412
    m_Localized: I marked our place. We will not lose the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945413
    m_Localized: Good. I sometimes forget how far we have come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945414
    m_Localized: I can do this descent with my eyes closed. That's what I tell nervous
      travellers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945415
    m_Localized: Keep them open for me. I want to know what the far anchor's doing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945416
    m_Localized: My ears caught a breeze. We will wait until you are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945417
    m_Localized: Almost ready. I am checking the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945418
    m_Localized: I used to mend that knot for you before you'd finished trying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945419
    m_Localized: Let me finish this one. Then check it. I do want you to check.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945420
    m_Localized: No need to hurry, little one. I am right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945421
    m_Localized: Then I will do this last part carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 592057964945422
    m_Localized: 'Our next job: {0}. Ready when you are.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 593227919908864
    m_Localized: Let us do this together. Then we can carry on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 599985858011136
    m_Localized: Wind is coming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 599985862205440
    m_Localized: The wind moved the row
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 600492383133696
    m_Localized: Wind moves the whole row one place on landing. Watch this example
      before going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650634661888
    m_Localized: Frost flask
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856192
    m_Localized: Match the flask picture. The bomb waits two swaps. The wood still
      wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856193
    m_Localized: Move the pictured piece above the frost flask. The bomb waits for
      two swaps, including this one. The wood still wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856194
    m_Localized: Match the flask picture. The bomb waits for two swaps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 605650638856195
    m_Localized: Bomb cooled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 613809549991936
    m_Localized: Tools and trophies for the journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 613809554186240
    m_Localized: Practice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232689020928
    m_Localized: '{0} coins added'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186752
    m_Localized: Back to shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186753
    m_Localized: A trophy or a few tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186754
    m_Localized: More for your collection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186755
    m_Localized: Try +{0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186756
    m_Localized: You have enough coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186757
    m_Localized: Two tools used. Try the next step yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186758
    m_Localized: Two tools per stage. With help, earn up to two stars. Five stars
      are yours to earn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186759
    m_Localized: Test shop. No money is charged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186760
    m_Localized: Coins are optional. Earn them by playing, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 643232714186761
    m_Localized: Advertising privacy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963959300096
    m_Localized: Tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494400
    m_Localized: '2 tools per stage. Help: up to 2 stars.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494401
    m_Localized: 'Test shop: no charge'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494402
    m_Localized: The store could not finish. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494403
    m_Localized: The shop is not open yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 644963963494404
    m_Localized: Coins can also be earned by playing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947791122432
    m_Localized: Basics
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316736
    m_Localized: Field guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316737
    m_Localized: Watch an example, then try it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316738
    m_Localized: Always with you. Free to read.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 673947795316739
    m_Localized: Open guide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676262187098112
    m_Localized: Try it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676262241624064
    m_Localized: Opens at level {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 676262241624065
    m_Localized: Fewer moves, more stars. Replay a level to improve your score.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689485263134720
    m_Localized: Strong gust
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689485288300544
    m_Localized: After your next swap, wind shifts the row. It can crack the board.
      Plan your move, or descend before the gust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 689485288300545
    m_Localized: 'Next swap: a strong gust. You can descend first.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647616
    m_Localized: A note from the dark beacon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647617
    m_Localized: The storm took our island lights. I will be waiting at the beacon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647618
    m_Localized: I will bring our little light to you. I just wish the bridges were
      lower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647619
    m_Localized: Below the islands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647620
    m_Localized: I built these bridges. Seeing them broken feels like losing old
      friends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647621
    m_Localized: Then we will give them new boards. Will you stay while I cross?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647622
    m_Localized: The receiver's order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647623
    m_Localized: Walter. Builder, bread lover, and your first travelling friend.
      I will stay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647624
    m_Localized: One bridge first. The beacon can wait for one careful step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647625
    m_Localized: A witness at the mill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647626
    m_Localized: Ben's mill used to sing all day. Now the buckets come back empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647627
    m_Localized: I can hear the rain. I cannot hear the water reaching the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647628
    m_Localized: The fast lever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647629
    m_Localized: I tried turning everything at once. My little brother got the biggest
      splash.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647630
    m_Localized: He is still here with his bucket. He believes you will mend it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647631
    m_Localized: A fault beyond the mill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647632
    m_Localized: I want to deserve that. Help me start with one wheel, Rin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647633
    m_Localized: One wheel, then one well. We will listen as we go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647634
    m_Localized: A seal on a crate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647635
    m_Localized: Without Rose's lantern fruit, the birds circle past their own nests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647636
    m_Localized: A home should be easy to find. Let us give them a light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647637
    m_Localized: Whose seal is on the crate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647638
    m_Localized: I saved the seeds before the fruit. Tomorrow needs a little care
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647639
    m_Localized: Can I carry a few? My pocket has room beside Grandma Ada's letter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647640
    m_Localized: Felt for a lens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647641
    m_Localized: Keep them warm. We will wake one tree and let the birds guide us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647642
    m_Localized: Small things can show a very long way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607473647643
    m_Localized: Tea at the post office
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841920
    m_Localized: Nora knows every sky route. The storm scattered the letters across
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841921
    m_Localized: There is a letter for Grandma Ada somewhere up there. We will find
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841922
    m_Localized: Ada's alleged order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841923
    m_Localized: I deliver everybody's letters. My own has waited in my pocket for
      months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841924
    m_Localized: Maybe you can write it while I mend the post bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841925
    m_Localized: The unattended desk
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841926
    m_Localized: First we get these letters home. Then I will find my first sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841927
    m_Localized: You could start with what you miss. That is how I started Grandma
      Ada's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841928
    m_Localized: Clara at the dock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841929
    m_Localized: The lagoon still shines like glass, but Clara's boats cannot find
      the shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841930
    m_Localized: Deep water makes my paws shake. I can still help from the pier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841931
    m_Localized: The letter beneath the cup
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841932
    m_Localized: My mother helped me fold this boat. I promised to keep its route
      open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841933
    m_Localized: Let us start with the nearest lamp. I can reach that one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841934
    m_Localized: Her mother's boat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841935
    m_Localized: You do not have to become brave all at once. I will hold the boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841936
    m_Localized: And I will make the first landing safe for both of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841937
    m_Localized: The archive door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841938
    m_Localized: Oscar keeps every island map in the archive. Rain has found a way
      in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841939
    m_Localized: We need the road through the snow. We can mend the roof on our way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841940
    m_Localized: The service key
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841941
    m_Localized: That map is the last copy. If you take it, what will stay on my
      shelf?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841942
    m_Localized: A space for the story we bring back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841943
    m_Localized: The equipment list
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841944
    m_Localized: A road belongs under someone's paws. I will help you read it, Rin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841945
    m_Localized: Then the archive is coming with us, one page at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841946
    m_Localized: A question on the map
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841947
    m_Localized: Snow covered the warm trail lamps. Even Alice cannot see the next
      ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841948
    m_Localized: I thought guides always knew the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841949
    m_Localized: The guide's cold paws
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841950
    m_Localized: I know this mountain. I do not know every snowflake. Stay close
      today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841951
    m_Localized: We can share my lantern. Grandma Ada's scarf is long enough for
      two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841952
    m_Localized: The shelter first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841953
    m_Localized: First we wake the steps. Then the mountain will show us its shape
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841954
    m_Localized: And if it does not, we will wait together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841955
    m_Localized: Two answering flashes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841956
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada kept a lamp in her window while the beacon was dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841957
    m_Localized: I saw it from the snow road. You knew I would come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841958
    m_Localized: The question at the door
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841959
    m_Localized: I hoped you would. Come warm your paws and tell me who helped you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841960
    m_Localized: So many friends. I brought a little piece of every island home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841961
    m_Localized: Ada's own delay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841962
    m_Localized: My knees dislike these stairs now. Will you carry the light beside
      me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841963
    m_Localized: I will, Grandma Ada. Let us make a light our friends can see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841964
    m_Localized: The light behind the lens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841965
    m_Localized: The beacon is shining. Above its clouds, the star routes are still
      dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841966
    m_Localized: Felix watches there. After breakfast, you could take him a light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841967
    m_Localized: Three flashes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841968
    m_Localized: I am Felix. My charts lost some stars. I have been trying to fix
      them alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841969
    m_Localized: There is room for two by your telescope. May I look with you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841970
    m_Localized: A gap in the chart
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841971
    m_Localized: The chart is not perfect yet. But perhaps we can start with the
      moon dial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841972
    m_Localized: We do not need every star to take the first step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841973
    m_Localized: First anchor. I'll hold the line until you tell me to lower it.
      Not a moment sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841974
    m_Localized: Wait. Let me check the receiver once more. You can see the knot
      from there, can't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841975
    m_Localized: The wind gate feeds a lamp below its hinges. Mind the changing row
      when you descend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841976
    m_Localized: Then I'll check the order after the gust. Is the far anchor secure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841977
    m_Localized: The lift relay has burnt out. Here's the workshop diagram; it shows
      where the spare contact goes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841978
    m_Localized: Can you replace it while I light the service landing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841979
    m_Localized: The market lamp won't catch until all its lower receivers are ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841980
    m_Localized: Does the baker have a hand lamp? We might be a while down here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841981
    m_Localized: This last bridge leads to Ben. I have not crossed it since the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841982
    m_Localized: Could it be from a tool? Let's keep the mark clear until we find
      yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841983
    m_Localized: The wheel needs a steady start. My paws always want to rush.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841984
    m_Localized: I'll take the lower receiver. Tell me if the wheel starts knocking
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841985
    m_Localized: The pipe reaches the houses, but its lamp is dark. My brother's
      tap is at the far end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841986
    m_Localized: Then that's where we test the repair. Not just here, where it's
      easy to see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841987
    m_Localized: The well clock stopped when the crate hit. I haven't touched its
      hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841988
    m_Localized: Leave them. We'll light the well and compare that time with Nora's
      book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841989
    m_Localized: The mail boat has a split seam. I can reach it from the lower landing,
      but its lamp is out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841990
    m_Localized: I'll light the landing. Bring your tools; the letters can wait somewhere
      dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841991
    m_Localized: Copper dust in the wheel. Rose's seal on the lid. I nearly threw
      both away as rubbish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841992
    m_Localized: Wrap them separately. Once this lamp is lit, we can ask Rose about
      the crate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841993
    m_Localized: The oldest tree gets the first lamp. Its roots hold the whole terrace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841994
    m_Localized: There's room by the outer rope. More lowering, less arguing with
      roots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841995
    m_Localized: Walter's missing chisel is here. I borrowed it for a graft and forgot
      to tell him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841996
    m_Localized: He can collect it when he checks the bridge. Which joint needs lighting
      first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841997
    m_Localized: Ben's jars are ready. The big ones are still on the top shelf. Couldn't
      find room for them down here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841998
    m_Localized: We can open the cart path today. Let Ben's brother choose the first
      jar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477841999
    m_Localized: The seed house is cold. These tiny things are next year's orchard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842000
    m_Localized: Then the book can wait. Show me where to lower the pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842001
    m_Localized: I know Nora well enough to lend her a crate. I didn't think to ask
      what Ada was sending.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842002
    m_Localized: She may have thought you knew. Let's take the packing entry so we
      can check it together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842003
    m_Localized: I can catch the envelopes. The heavy bag needs a lit landing below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842004
    m_Localized: I'll take the lower rope. Anything that falls, I'll catch from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842005
    m_Localized: The delivery order is in the sorting room. Its lamp went out; I
      nearly fell over a parcel going in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842006
    m_Localized: I'll light it from below. Wait by the door; we can look for the
      order together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842007
    m_Localized: I flew over the broken mail bridge. It took me a week to notice
      the carts couldn't follow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842008
    m_Localized: You can watch the far anchor from the air. I'll test the lower relay
      with the load.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842009
    m_Localized: The mail basket is heavy. I tucked my unfinished letter underneath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842010
    m_Localized: We can lift the basket. You can finish one sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842011
    m_Localized: The northbound receipt has a tide mark. Clara keeps those times
      better than any clock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842012
    m_Localized: We'll open the lagoon gate, then take both records to her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842013
    m_Localized: The tide is rising towards the lower landing. I can hold the boat
      here while you light the pier lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842014
    m_Localized: Read the tide to me. I'll read the receiver to you. We stop if either
      changes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842015
    m_Localized: Each pond lamp marks a turn. My mother's boat knew them all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842016
    m_Localized: We'll follow the ledges, not the reflections. Keep Nora's receipt
      dry for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842017
    m_Localized: The storm knocked that beam down. Boats can't pass with their sails
      up. I'll lift it once the landing is lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842018
    m_Localized: I'll light both ends. Ask Nora to keep the boats back until you've
      secured it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842019
    m_Localized: Your hand lamp is almost empty. I've a spare upstairs. Light the
      stair lamp and I'll fetch it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842020
    m_Localized: Thanks. I'll keep Ada's to return to her. Is there enough oil in
      the spare for the pass?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842021
    m_Localized: Oscar keeps the maintenance records. Tell him the tide and the clock
      agree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842022
    m_Localized: I'll bring him the copies. The originals stay with you and Nora.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842023
    m_Localized: The storm jammed the lift with the register inside. Light its relay;
      I'll free the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842024
    m_Localized: Is the page caught in the hinge? Don't start the lift until you've
      freed it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842025
    m_Localized: The shelf lift has its own little key. I put it somewhere exceptionally
      safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842026
    m_Localized: Your waistcoat pocket, perhaps? That's where you kept checking when
      we came in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842027
    m_Localized: The storm map is behind this case. I have never let it travel before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842028
    m_Localized: Maybe it has been waiting for a journey too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842029
    m_Localized: Water is reaching the north-route petitions. I shelved them under
      Unfinished Matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842030
    m_Localized: Let's dry them. Then put them where Ada will have to read them again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842031
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada left this note between two maps. I saved it for when
      you were ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842032
    m_Localized: Does Lumi know that turn? We'll check it with her and bring you
      the correction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842033
    m_Localized: Count the buried lamps, not my footprints. Snow can fill a footprint
      in a breath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842034
    m_Localized: You count. I'll relight them. Snow won't cover that signal so easily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842035
    m_Localized: I built this shelter for others. Today I need its warmth too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842036
    m_Localized: Today we'll stop. You need warm paws to secure my rope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842037
    m_Localized: The arch turns the row before the landing. I used to know its order
      by heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842038
    m_Localized: The ice has moved it. We'll read this receiver as it is now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842039
    m_Localized: Ben's second blanket is on the supply landing. Its lamp is buried
      in snow; no one can see the steps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842040
    m_Localized: Clear the lamp while I reach its receiver. Then we can carry the
      blanket in without falling down the steps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842041
    m_Localized: The beacon is on the left fork. The right one follows the beam to
      the observatory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842042
    m_Localized: Ada first. We have her permit number, but we still haven't heard
      her side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842043
    m_Localized: My last bridge lamp. I used to check this rope every dawn. Now I
      can't reach the first rung.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842044
    m_Localized: Tell me what to look for. I can reach the lower anchor from here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842045
    m_Localized: The lantern lift has waited all storm. I could not mend it alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842046
    m_Localized: You waited for me. Now we have enough paws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842047
    m_Localized: Put Nora's order here. The number and seal are mine. I never saw
      this delivery copy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842048
    m_Localized: It says to move a source with the relays connected. Is that part
      of your trial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842049
    m_Localized: We can test the north beam with these relays. But we cannot light
      the empty beacon yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842050
    m_Localized: Then ready every receiver. Returning the lantern won't help if its
      route is broken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842051
    m_Localized: I kept saying the north route was too risky. Clara kept sending
      boats. I knew that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842052
    m_Localized: We'll show her the new plan before using it. She knows that water
      better than either of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842053
    m_Localized: The timing wheel stopped when the High Lantern was moved. The lamps
      below can't hold a steady signal until I reset it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842054
    m_Localized: I'll light the service landing. Reset the wheel, then we'll test
      the next relay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842055
    m_Localized: The far lens is across this bridge. I measured the beam from my
      desk and missed the dead patch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842056
    m_Localized: We need Nora above that turn. I'll ask her to signal when she can
      see the landing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842057
    m_Localized: The star charts blew apart. I was waiting to find every corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842058
    m_Localized: You left that connection out of Ben's copy. He couldn't have found
      the cause from what you sent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842059
    m_Localized: I did. I took it. Used Ada's permit number and changed the load.
      I meant to light the north for one night, then bring it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842060
    m_Localized: And kept quiet when the lamps failed. We'll come back to that. Hold
      the source; Nora's bringing the pilot through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842061
    m_Localized: The north chain is holding. I was afraid Ada would shut the trial
      down if I told her. So I let Ben blame himself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842062
    m_Localized: Tell him yourself. Send the full chart, then take Walter through
      every damaged relay. Ada's waiting for the Lantern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842063
    m_Localized: The Observatory
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842064
    m_Localized: Felix
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842065
    m_Localized: I am Felix. The constellations went dark. I know the sky, but I
      need another pair of eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842066
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada's beacon is shining. Let us help its light reach the
      night travellers too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842067
    m_Localized: Restore a steady relay signal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842068
    m_Localized: Light the blind turn below the lens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842069
    m_Localized: Restore the complete chart's relays
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842070
    m_Localized: Guide the glider through the dark turn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842071
    m_Localized: Return the High Lantern; open the north route
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842072
    m_Localized: The first relays are steady. Nora says the pilot can see the landing
      now, but the turn is still dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842073
    m_Localized: Keep the beam on the landing. We'll open the rest of the route before
      they try to cross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842074
    m_Localized: Nora sees the new lamp. The pilot can move to the next landing;
      the final turn still needs the lower chain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842075
    m_Localized: Your stars look closer when you share them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842076
    m_Localized: The charts have gaps, but their routes join. I was waiting for too
      much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842077
    m_Localized: We found enough sky to keep going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842078
    m_Localized: The glider cleared the turn. Nora signalled; Clara saw it from the
      water. The lower chain holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842079
    m_Localized: Now we can lower the High Lantern. Nora, stay with the pilot. Felix,
      on my count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842080
    m_Localized: Ada has the High Lantern home. And my key. Walter's waiting at the
      first anchor. We start the repairs at dawn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842081
    m_Localized: I'll give Gran her hand lamp back. I'll keep Clara's. I'll need
      it on the morning rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842082
    m_Localized: My drawing shows this ledge lit. I never came down to check it from
      below.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842083
    m_Localized: Nora, can you see the far turn? Tell him where the light stops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842084
    m_Localized: The clearest sky still has clouds. I am learning to look between
      them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842085
    m_Localized: There is room for our next step between these boards too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842086
    m_Localized: The beacon is bright, but the sky paths are still dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842087
    m_Localized: Felix has been waiting above the clouds. Tonight we will help him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842088
    m_Localized: The moon dial is turning. Its light reaches a tiny telescope.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842089
    m_Localized: Felix says he used to watch alone. I will watch with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842090
    m_Localized: These star charts blew out of Felix's notebook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842091
    m_Localized: Some corners are missing. There is still enough to find the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842092
    m_Localized: One constellation is awake. I can see the next in its light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842093
    m_Localized: The stars are far apart. Their pattern brings them together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842094
    m_Localized: A little glider is following our new sky path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842095
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada's beacon and Felix's stars are shining together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842096
    m_Localized: I thought I had to mend every bridge before I could cross one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842097
    m_Localized: You crossed the first part with me. That was enough for today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842098
    m_Localized: My brother put red thread on his bucket handle. Says he's checking
      before he pulls too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842099
    m_Localized: Has he put the bucket down yet? I wanted to ask him to help with
      the boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842100
    m_Localized: Those three seeds are still in your pocket. Ada used to plant something
      after every hard winter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842101
    m_Localized: I'll find her three pots. There's bound to be room on that windowsill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842102
    m_Localized: 'I wrote the first sentence: I miss having tea with you. It was
      easier than I feared.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842103
    m_Localized: Then the next sentence can wait until we lift this basket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842104
    m_Localized: Nora asked what time supper is. Not which delivery could fit before
      it. Just what time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607477842105
    m_Localized: I'll check the bench lamp before we leave. You'll want it when supper
      runs late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036224
    m_Localized: There is an empty space on my shelf now. It feels like an open door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036225
    m_Localized: Keep it for us. I will bring the map back with a story.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036226
    m_Localized: Put a sign to the shelter beside the path. You can't see the door
      from that side in the snow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036227
    m_Localized: Hang it inside, away from the snow. I'll clear the bottom step so
      the door opens all the way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036228
    m_Localized: You ask for help sooner now. That is something a keeper needs to
      learn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036229
    m_Localized: I learnt it from a whole sky of friends. And you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036230
    m_Localized: I left the unfinished chart on the table. Someone added a star while
      we worked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036231
    m_Localized: Maybe another observer wanted a place beside you too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036232
    m_Localized: Finish level first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036233
    m_Localized: Finish your current level before starting a stamp trail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036234
    m_Localized: Light the constellations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036235
    m_Localized: '{0}: {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036236
    m_Localized: The sky shines again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036237
    m_Localized: A light for every traveller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 730607482036238
    m_Localized: Rin brought the light home. Together, her friends lit the way beyond
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 752843987345408
